WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.850
Light Avenger approaches after the heavy-Knuckle knockdown.

2
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.450
Ken blocks No Chaser.

3
00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:02.050
Luke steps out of Ken’s throw range before punishing the miss.

4
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.550
Standing heavy punch punishes the throw whiff.

5
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.500
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle starts the juggle.

6
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.800
Perfect light Flash Knuckle lifts Ken again.

7
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.200
Heavy Flash Knuckle finishes the conversion.
